                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "58c38f2c-808b-333e-9fdd-c2a5dac92475",
                        "entry_id": "ea012704-e9cf-372d-8067-8364154e011a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "относящийся к яхте, яхтам"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e334b10-9098-4773-a8f7-a23c926e463b",
                                "sense_id": "58c38f2c-808b-333e-9fdd-c2a5dac92475",
                                "text": "Мы испугались, что декларации Жоржа осуществятся слишком буквально: яхтенный прожектор как на грех не действовал, и за ночь, в кромешной тьме, «Ра» и «Шенандоа» рисковали разойтись навсегда."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "47f217de-382e-4de7-95e8-98e546519975",
                        "source_entry_id": "ea012704-e9cf-372d-8067-8364154e011a",
                        "source_sense_id": "58c38f2c-808b-333e-9fdd-c2a5dac92475",
                        "target_lang_word": "yacht",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "yacht",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ade4f8b-e58e-3348-883d-5d6bc5d92017",
                                        "entry_id": "48583370-6037-3350-ae1c-57f32e95806d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A slick and light ship for making pleasure trips or racing on water, having sails but often motor-powered. At times used as a residence offshore on a dock."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa71d1aa-557c-4c3d-9fe0-24f0b0926b05",
                                                "sense_id": "1ade4f8b-e58e-3348-883d-5d6bc5d92017",
                                                "text": "Would you like to go sailing on my uncle’s yacht?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04659abb-f83d-4f61-8c0b-a574466c9a10",
                                                "sense_id": "1ade4f8b-e58e-3348-883d-5d6bc5d92017",
                                                "text": "You are a true yachtsman! Are you a member of the local yacht club?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe658741-1932-41fa-b2f8-676b4853db12",
                                                "sense_id": "1ade4f8b-e58e-3348-883d-5d6bc5d92017",
                                                "text": "The skipper Mr. Cooke had hired at Far Harbor was a God-fearing man with a luke warm interest in his new billet and employer, and had only been prevailed upon to take charge of the yacht after the offer of an emolument equal to half a year's sea pay of an ensign in the navy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c42031d9-f713-30f7-93ed-5ef36e2787c8",
                                        "entry_id": "48583370-6037-3350-ae1c-57f32e95806d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any vessel used for private, noncommercial purposes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b89b3fe2-9360-43c1-a110-965383034635",
                                                "sense_id": "c42031d9-f713-30f7-93ed-5ef36e2787c8",
                                                "text": "“I don’t mean all of your friends—only a small proportion—which, however, connects your circle with that deadly, idle, brainless bunch—the insolent chatterers at the opera,[…], the chlorotic squatters on huge yachts,[…], the neurotic victims of mental cirrhosis, the jewelled animals whose moral code is the code of the barnyard—!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31ba6f0e-69fe-4d55-b6d4-060df5c46e0d",
                                                "sense_id": "c42031d9-f713-30f7-93ed-5ef36e2787c8",
                                                "text": "The megayacht concept is equipped with its own port with enough space for a second yacht measuring up to 30 meters, as well as three swimming pools. […] The market is projected to reach a value of $10.2 billion by 2025 as an increasing amount of yachts measuring longer than 24 meters are ordered, and designers are going all out to ensure their concepts are bigger and better than the competition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
